            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/geometry"} geometry
            and
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/logic"} logic
          %p
            We give here an introduction to the basic concepts and results, aimed at providing background for the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/synthetic+differential+geometry"} synthetic
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/higher+differential+geometry"} higher
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/geometry+of+physics+--+supergeometry"} supergeometry
            of relevance in formulations of fundamental
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/physics"} physics
            %em
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/geometry+of+physics+--+perturbative+quantum+field+theory"} on perturbative quantum field theory
            and
            = succeed "." do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/geometry+of+physics+--+fundamental+super+p-branes"} on fundamental super p-branes
            = succeed "." do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/Introduction+to+Higher+Supergeometry"} Introduction to Higher Supergeometry
          %p
            This makes use of the following curious dictionary between
            = succeed "/" do
