                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} (d_1 \overset{g}{\to} d_2) \in Hom_{\mathcal{D}}(d_1,d_2)
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/composition"} composition
                is defined by composition in each entry:
              %ul
                %li
                  %p
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}>
