              (Def.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#AdjunctionUnitFromHomIsomorphism"}
              below) and depending on their behaviour special cases of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/adjunctions"} adjunctions
              are identified (Prop.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#FullyFaithfulAndInvertibleAdjoints"}
              below), which we discuss in detail in following sections:
            %table{:style => "margin:auto"}
