                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} L(c) \overset{f}{\to} d
                    is obtained from
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
