            %p
              This equivalent perspective on adjoint functors makes manifest that adjoint functors are, if they exist, unique up to natural isomorphism, this is Prop.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#UniquenessOfAdjoints"}
              below.
            #AdjointFunctorFromObjectwiseRepresentingObject.num_prop
