            %p
              To complete this pattern, we will see below in Prop.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#EveryEquivalenceOfCategoriesComesFromAnAdjointEquivalence"}
              that following are equivalent:
            %ul
              %li
                %p
                  the
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/adjunction+unit"} unit
