            #MonoidModuleOverItself.num_prop
              %h6#proposition_5 Proposition
              %p
                In the situation of def.
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#ModulesInMonoidalCategory"}
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
