              %p
                From this, the universal property of limits of sets (as in Remark
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#LimitingCones"}
                %em unique
                morphism between the pointwise limits which constitutes a presheaf over
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi 𝒞
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{C}
              .maruku-equation
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
