                        %mi F
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ˜
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \tilde F
                is required to preserve any colimit and hence these particular colimits,
                %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:YonedaRestriction"} (59)
                implies that
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
