                        %mo ˜
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \widetilde F
                is fixed to act, up to isomorphism, as
              .maruku-equation
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
