            %h3#local_presentation Local presentation
            %p
              We now discuss a more abstract characterization of
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/sheaf+toposes"} sheaf toposes
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/adjunction"} adjunction
              that relates them to the corresponding
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/categories+of+presheaves"} categories of presheaves
            #LocallyPresentableCategory.num_defn
              %h6#definition_7 Definition
              %p
                %strong
                  (
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/locally+presentable+category"}> locally presentable category
                  )
              %p
                A
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/category"} category
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
