                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} ptp_{\mathbf{B}}
                is an epimorphism. By
                %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:PiecesToPointsFromBase"} (31)
                we have
                = succeed "," do
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %msub
