                being a weak equivalence, for these it is actually an acyclic cofibrations.
              %p Some authors call cylinder/path-space objects with this extra property “very good” cylinder/path-space objects, respectively.
              %p
                One may also consider dropping a condition in def.
                = succeed ":" do
                  %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#PathAndCylinderObjectsInAModelCategory"}
                %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#PathAndCylinderObjectsInAModelCategory"}
                but without the condition that
