            #EssentialUniquenessOfLocalizationFunctorOfModelCategory.num_remark
              %h6#remark_5 Remark
              %p
                Due to theorem
                %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#UniversalPropertyOfHomotopyCategoryOfAModelCategory"}
                we may suppress the choices of cofibrant
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi Q
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Q
                and fibrant replacement
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi P
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} P
                in def.
                %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#FibrantCofibrantReplacementFunctorToHomotopyCategory"}
                and just speak of
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/generalized+the"} the
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/localization+functor"} localization functor
              .maruku-equation
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi γ
                      %mspace{:width => "thickmathspace"}
                      %mo{:lspace => "verythinmathspace"} :
                      %mspace{:width => "thickmathspace"}
                      %mi 𝒞
                      %mo ⟶
                      %mi Ho
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                      %mi 𝒞
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"}
                      \\gamma \;\colon\;
                      \\mathcal{C}
                      \\longrightarrow
                      Ho(\mathcal{C})
              %p
                up to
                = succeed "." do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/natural+isomorphism"} natural isomorphism
            %p
              In general, the localization
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi 𝒞
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} [
                    %msup
                      %mi W
                      %mrow
                        %mo{:lspace => "verythinmathspace", :rspace => "0em"} −
                        %mn 1
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ]
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{C}[W^{-1}]
              of a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/category+with+weak+equivalences"} category with weak equivalences
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
