                      \\\
                      \&amp; \simeq
                      \\gamma_{\mathcal{D}}F(Q(P(X)) )
                      \\end{aligned}
                      \\,.
              %p
                But since
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi F
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} F
                is a homotopical functor on fibrant objects, the cofibrant replacement morphism
