                      %mi P
                      %mi d
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} j_d \colon d \to P d
                to a weak equivalence.
              %p
                The adjunction unit of
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
