                %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#MorphismIsWeakEquivalenceIfIsoInHomotopyCategoryForQuillen"}
                the localization functor of a
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/model+category"} model category
                inverts precisely the
                = succeed "." do
