              %h6#proof_24 Proof
              %p
                This follows immediately from the fact that passing to
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+categories+of+model+categories"} homotopy categories of model categories
                is a
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/double+pseudofunctor"} double pseudofunctor
                from the
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/double+category+of+model+categories"} double category of model categories
                to the
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/double+category+of+squares"} double category of squares
                in
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cat"} Cat
                (Prop.
                = succeed ")." do
                  %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#HomotopyDoublePseudofunctor"}
