              %p
                These are going to be called the
                %strong
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/generating+cofibrations"} generating cofibrations
                and
                %strong acyclic generating cofibrations
                for the
                %em
                  projective
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/model+structure+on+functors"} model structure on topologically enriched functors
                over
                = succeed "." do
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %mi 𝒞
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{C}
              %p
                Analgously, for
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi 𝒞
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{C}
                a pointed topologically enriched category, write
              .maruku-equation
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
