            #ProjectiveModelStructureOnTopologicalFunctors.num_theorem
              %h6#theorem_5 Theorem
              %p
                The classes of morphisms in def.
                %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#ClassesOfMorphismsInTheProjectiveModelStructureOnTopEnrichedFunctors"}
                constitute a
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/model+category"} model category
                structure on
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
