            %p
              The concept of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy"} homotopy
              of morphisms between simplicial sets proceeds in direct analogy with that in
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topological+spaces"} topological spaces
            #LeftHomotopyOfSimplicialSets.num_defn
