            %p
              We now discuss how to extract derived
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/adjoint+modalities"} adjoint modalities
              from systems of
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Quillen+adjoint+triples"} Quillen adjoint triples
            #DerivedAdjunctionUnitOfQuillenAdjointTriple.num_lemma
              %h6#lemma Lemma
              %p
                %strong
                  (
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/derived+adjunction+units"} derived adjunction units
                  of
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Quillen+adjoint+triple"} Quillen adjoint triple
              %p
                Consider a
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Quillen+adjoint+triple"} Quillen adjoint triple
                (Def.
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#QuillenAdjointTriple"}
              .maruku-equation
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %msub
                        %mi 𝒞
                        %mn 1
                      %munderover
                        %mrow
                          %msub
