              %p
                Since the
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/colimit"} colimit
                of a
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/representable"} representable
                is the singleton (Lemma
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#ColimitOfRepresentableIsSingleton"}
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/limit"} limit
                over the opposite of a category with terming object is evaluation at that object, this in turn is equivalent to
              .maruku-equation
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mrow
                        %mtable
                          %mtr
