              %p
                Here we recognize the
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/internal+hom"} internal hom
                in
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/simplicial+sets"} simplicial sets
                from the weak equivalences of the definition of an
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%E2%88%9E-cohesive+site"} ∞-cohesive site
                (Def.
                = succeed ")," do
                  %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#InfinityCohesiveSite"}
                = succeed "." do
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
