            %p
              The following is the analog in
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+theory"} homotopy theory
              of the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cohesion"} cohesive
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/adjoint+modalities"} adjoint modalities
              from Def.
              = succeed ":" do
                %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#CohesiveModalities"}
            #DerivedCohesiveModalities.num_defn
              %h6#definition_13 Definition
              %p
